{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "edp-alerts",
  "title": "EDP - Alerts & SLO",
  "tags": ["edp", "alerts"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "description": "Layar yang dibuka saat alert berbunyi. Ekspresi tiap panel SENGAJA sama persis dengan ekspresi di infra/prometheus/rules/edp-alerts.yml -- dashboard yang memakai rumus sendiri akan cepat berbeda pendapat dengan alertnya, dan pertengkaran itu selalu dimenangkan orang yang berhenti mempercayai keduanya.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Alert yang sedang berbunyi",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Diambil dari metrik ALERTS milik Prometheus sendiri, bukan dari Alertmanager -- panel ini tetap berisi walau pengiriman ke webhook sedang gagal.",
      "options": { "showHeader": true },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "Value": true, "__name__": true, "job": true },
            "renameByName": {
              "alertname": "Alert",
              "service": "Service",
              "severity": "Tingkat",
              "alertstate": "Status"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Ketersediaan per service (rata-rata up)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "1 = selalu bisa di-scrape sepanjang rentang waktu yang dipilih. Turun di bawah 1 berarti ada jendela waktu saat service tidak menjawab.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.99 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.999 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "avg_over_time(up{job=\"edp-services\"}[$__range])",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Rasio 5xx per service (ambang alert 5%)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Ekspresi sama dengan alert HighErrorRate. Garis ambang di 0,05 adalah titik alert itu mulai menghitung 10 menit.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"edp-services\",status=~\"5..\"}[10m])) / sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"edp-services\"}[10m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "P95 latensi per service (ambang alert 1s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Ekspresi sama dengan alert HighLatencyP95.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line" } },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (service, le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"edp-services\"}[10m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Route penyumbang 5xx terbanyak",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Pertanyaan berikutnya setelah 'service mana yang error' selalu 'endpoint mana'. Label route adalah pola rute (mis. GET /accounts/{id}), bukan URL mentah, jadi aman dikelompokkan.",
      "options": { "showHeader": true },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (service, route, status) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"edp-services\",status=~\"5..\"}[10m])))",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "job": true },
            "renameByName": {
              "service": "Service",
              "route": "Route",
              "status": "Status",
              "Value": "req/s"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "403 di api-gateway (endpoint yang belum terdaftar di policy.go?)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Setiap endpoint harus terdaftar di api-gateway/internal/authz/policy.go; yang tidak terdaftar ditolak. Gelombang 403 yang menetap biasanya berarti endpoint baru yang lupa didaftarkan -- bukan pengguna yang iseng. Ambang alert 0,2 req/s selama 15 menit.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line" } },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.2 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{service=\"api-gateway\",status=\"403\"}[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Log error terbaru (semua container)",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "description": "Promtail memberi label `container` (nama container Docker) dan `stream`. Filter di bawah mencari baris yang mengandung kata error -- log service di repo ini berformat teks, bukan JSON.",
      "options": { "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "{container=~\".+\"} |~ \"(?i)error\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
